# Whitelist: only the agent itself is tracked. Everything else in the
# working tree (RetroPatch reference code, experiments, docs, receipts,
# virtualenvs, run outputs) stays out of this repository.
/*
!/aosp_agent
!/scripts
!/README.md
aosp_agent/**/__pycache__/
aosp_agent/oracles/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
!/.gitignore
